# Going from an Overdue entry to the outline, quitting and reopening, then Back still returns to the Overdue view, whose entries work as before.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
END
keys gO j .
see 󰋜 › Work
restart
see 󰋜 › Work
keys H
see 󰨱 Overdue
keys G }
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-1})
END
